f the quests are moving and were, frankly, shocking and surprising to me.\nIf you haven't done so yet, give it a genuine try.  Its not perfect but it is VERY good!", "timestamp_created": 1671835698, "timestamp_updated": 1671835698, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "129126831", "author": {"steamid": "76561198125757426", "personaname": "Saltzpyre gaming", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198125757426/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 38950, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 36407, "last_played": 1756221477, "avatar": "70a3b9a117ec4af3b4a16125d0e6d4a17880db21"}, "language": "english", "review": "Well my Country got added to the \" Digital Extremes region restrictions\" bit sad", "timestamp_created": 1671833671, "timestamp_updated": 1671833671, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}